{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/called-in-decision-royal-mint-court-london-ec3n-4qn-refs-3353754-and-3353755-20-january-2026","content_id":"ec4a7c62-e039-4ad5-ae22-5a2896911f6f","description":"Decision letter and Inspector’s Report for a called-in application and associated annexes.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"696f5853f6aa424b452e334b","filename":"260120_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC_-_Royal_Mint_Court_London__3353754_and_3353755_.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":5394773,"filename":"260120_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC_-_Royal_Mint_Court_London__3353754_and_3353755_.pdf","id":"9083062","isbn":"","number_of_pages":240,"title":"Called-in decision: Royal Mint Court, London, EC3N 4QN (refs. 3353754 and 3353755 - 20 January 2026)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/696f5853f6aa424b452e334b/260120_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC_-_Royal_Mint_Court_London__3353754_and_3353755_.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"696f610c7e827090d02d4208","filename":"Annex_C_-_Consolidated_Drawing_Schedule_and_revised_drawings.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":25227190,"filename":"Annex_C_-_Consolidated_Drawing_Schedule_and_revised_drawings.pdf","id":"9083063","isbn":"","number_of_pages":53,"title":"Annex C: Consolidated Drawing Schedule and revised drawings","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/696f610c7e827090d02d4208/Annex_C_-_Consolidated_Drawing_Schedule_and_revised_drawings.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Decision letter and Inspector’s Report for called-in applications for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Redevelopment of the site to provide an embassy (Sui Generis use class), involving the refurbishment and restoration of the Johnson Smirke Building (Grade II* listed), partial demolition, remodelling and refurbishment of Seaman’s Registry (Grade II listed), with alterations to the west elevation of the building, the retention, part demolition, alterations and extensions to Murray House and Dexter House, the erection of a standalone entrance pavilion building, alterations to the existing boundary wall and demolition of substation, associated public realm and landscaping, highway works, car and cycle parking and all ancillary and associated works.</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Refurbishment and restoration of the Johnson Smirke Building (Grade II* listed), partial demolition, remodelling and refurbishment of the Seaman’s Registry (Grade II listed), with alterations to the west elevation of the building, the retention, along with part demolition and alterations to the existing boundary wall and front railings and demolition of substation, associated landscaping, and all ancillary and associated works.</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-20T00:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;file_download&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/696f5853f6aa424b452e334b/260120_Combined_DL_IR_RtoC_-_Royal_Mint_Court_London__3353754_and_3353755_.pdf\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--pdf\" version=\"